WEBVTT

00:07:28.796 --> 00:07:30.876
non-polluting technologies

00:07:30.876 --> 00:07:31.876
on the market today,

00:07:31.876 --> 00:07:33.596
ready to go to scale,

00:07:33.596 --> 00:07:38.956
including membrane technologies
that can both cool and dehumidify air

00:07:38.956 --> 00:07:41.556
without using compressors or refrigerants.

00:07:41.956 --> 00:07:43.836
So the Kigali Amendment,

00:07:43.836 --> 00:07:48.236
together with a ban on the exports
and imports of illegal HFCs,

00:07:48.236 --> 00:07:49.596
could make a real difference

00:07:49.596 --> 00:07:50.996
and grow that market fast.

00:07:52.316 --> 00:07:55.676
And fourth, we need cold chains
for food, medicines --

00:07:55.676 --> 00:07:57.116
especially vaccines --

00:07:57.116 --> 00:07:58.316
for everyone.

00:07:59.596 --> 00:08:03.156
Distributing vaccines
along a secure cold chain